bilities. The page should include: Each champion’s name, title, region, and role (e.g., tank, mage, ADC) Detailed descriptions of each skill (Q/W/E/R), with cooldown, damage type, and base values Tips on champion usage, synergy, and counters Include champion art, animated skill icons, and embedded gameplay videos The page should support filtering (by role, difficulty, faction, type) and be mobile-friendly",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/webpage1.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1922113979076218880?outputId=&outputType=&projectId=1922113979076218880&dataType=project&shareType=demo"},{title:"Niche Indie Games Showcase",id:"1921868503966101504",content:"Create a retro pixel-art style webpage to showcase and recommend niche indie games, including screenshot galleries, developer bios, Steam redirection links, and player review summaries.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/webpage2.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1921868503966101504?outputId=&outputType=&projectId=1921868503966101504&dataType=project&shareType=demo"},{title:"Explore Unique Travel Destinations",id:"1922902446632980480",content:"Design a webpage for an interest site exploring lesser-known travel destinations around the world. It should include map navigation, category tags (such as 'Ruins Enthusiasts', 'Secret Adventures'), on-site stories, and a traveler message board. The webpage should feature special effects and have an overall style rich in natural elements and materials.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/webpage3.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1922902446632980480?dataType=project&projectId=1922902446632980480&shareType=demo"}],[{title:"The Mystery of the Black Dahlia",id:"1921902357237895168",content:"Search for the Black Dahlia case, thoroughly investigate its background and details, and present the information to me in an engaging storytelling style.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/podcast1.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1921902357237895168?outputId=&outputType=&projectId=1921902357237895168&dataType=project&shareType=demo"},{title:"Monetizing AI While Working",id:"1922906171155337216",content:"Help me produce a podcast. The theme is: You Can Make Money with AI Without Quitting Your Job.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/podcast2.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1922906171155337216?dataType=project&projectId=1922906171155337216&shareType=demo"},{title:"Empowering Women's Sports Health",id:"1922911861391413248",content:"I want to create an episode of a podcast about women's sports health.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/podcast3.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1922911861391413248?dataType=project&projectId=1922911861391413248&shareType=demo"}],[{title:"Teddy Bear's Global Adventure Vlog",id:"1922539593100349440",content:"Help me generate a travel vlog of teddy bear, which includes him traveling to the Eiffel Tower in France, the Statue of Liberty in the United States, the Great Wall of China, the Sydney Opera House in Australia, the Pyramids of Egypt, the Taj Mahal in India, Mount Fuji in Japan, etc., and taking selfies with these famous attractions, with light and cheerful music.",img:"https://static.skywork.ai/fe/skywork-site-assets/images/home/cases/general1.png",url:"https://skywork.ai/web/share/project/1922539593100349440?dataType=project&projectId=1922539593100349440&shareType=demo"},{title:"White Kitten Under Cherry Blossom",id:"1921777551540826112",content:"Create a cozy scene with a white kitten sitting under a cherry blossom tree, curiously watching the falling petals. The pink flowers of the cherry blossom tree sway gently in the breeze, and petals fall softly around the kitten. The grass is covered with cherry blossoms, creati